docs {
  Public catalogue for `/services` and `/services/{slug}`.

  **No JWT.** The site never sends a staff token here.

  ## How the frontend loads a detail page
  1. `GET /api/v1/services?page=1&page_size=50` — find the row by `slug`
  2. `GET /api/v1/services/{id}` — hydrate the full CMS row

  A slug in the path (`/api/v1/services/web-platforms`) is **422**. The API only accepts a UUID.
}
